ow to make it last.”"],"donts":["“Guaranteed results” / “permanent results”","“Cures / treats / heals” any condition","“Pain-free” or “zero risk”","“FDA-approved” (unless you can prove the exact device/product is)","“Anti-ageing miracle” or “erase wrinkles”","Body-shaming hooks (“fix your flaws”)","“Doctor-recommended” without a named source","Before/afters without written client consent","Fake urgency (“only 1 spot left!” when it isn’t true)","Comparing yourself negatively to named competitors"],"signOff":"With love, Mia","emojiPolicy":"minimal","favouriteEmojis":["✨","🤍"]}'::jsonb, 'https://lunalash.example.com/book', '@lunalashstudio', 7000, 1400, 32, 'USD', 'en-US', 'America/Chicago', 1, '2026-11-07T23:57:37.087Z');

